    "body": "## Problem\n\nA terminal can return several capabilities in one XTGETTCAP response. Only the first name is processed, its value is lost, and the remaining capabilities are reported as missing after the timeout.\n\n## Solution\n\nProcess each semicolon-separated name/value pair and retain the requested capability filter. Extend the existing TermResponse channel test to check two string capabilities returned in one response.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-18T20:58:28Z",
